{
  "id": "DOC-20-Ta7997",
  "title": "Text: DET Greg Garno ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2020-06-04",
  "from": "DET Greg Garno",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:57 PM",
      "text": "You know who I’m starting to love"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "6:57 PM",
      "text": "Me?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:57 PM",
      "text": "No, Kaitlin Collins"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "6:58 PM",
      "text": "She’s hot. I like Katy Tur on MSNBC. Was hotter before she was covering the campaign and before she got pregnant."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:58 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:58 PM",
      "text": "My next comment was gonna be, “She took over the No. 1 spot from Katy Tur”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:58 PM",
      "text": "Do you know she dated Keith Olbermann?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:00 PM",
      "text": "Who, Katy Tur?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:00 PM",
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:01 PM",
      "text": "I just looked it up because I thought you were fucking with me. He was born in 1959. She was born in 1983. WHAT THE FUCK"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:01 PM",
      "text": "I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:01 PM",
      "text": "I’m rattled dude"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:01 PM",
      "text": "Why Keith Olbermann"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:02 PM",
      "text": "For real. I have so many questions."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:29 PM",
      "text": "https://us02web.zoom.us/j/86314958446"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:29 PM",
      "text": "I got it"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:30 PM",
      "text": "Waiting for it to start"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:30 PM",
      "text": "LoCo can get it, too"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:30 PM",
      "text": "She’s the host of the damn thing and hasn’t started it yet? SMH"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:33 PM",
      "text": "Do you think the Tigers should host a Miller lite happy hour with four prospects on Tuesday afternoon? Not sure if that’s too soon or not."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:35 PM",
      "text": "Hmmmm"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "Probably"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "Will be the state be open then?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:36 PM",
      "text": "Get in this fucking thing where are you"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:37 PM",
      "text": "I need someone to share in the awkwardness"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:45 PM",
      "text": "GET BACK"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "8:45 PM",
      "text": "HURRY"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "8:50 PM",
      "text": "Are we allowed to look online?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:01 PM",
      "text": "I don’t think so"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:01 PM",
      "text": "I know"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:01 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:02 PM",
      "text": "That stache is so hard"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:03 PM",
      "text": "I think I need to shave it"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:09 PM",
      "text": "I got 12 on the last one so I would have gotten 17..."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:09 PM",
      "text": "I don’t want to say anything though"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:09 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:09 PM",
      "text": "I went 4 for 5 on beer, 3 for 5 on cats, 5 for 5 on sports"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:11 PM",
      "text": "That was cool"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:11 PM",
      "text": "Only a half hour"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:26 PM",
      "text": "I can’t believe Scott Bell has a paywall on his blog"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:27 PM",
      "text": "I mean ... I’m probably underrating his importance to the Michigan fanbase but still"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:06 PM",
      "text": "LoCo is Laura Coates"
    }
  ]
}